  "inferential_caveats": [
    "200/200 bootstrap records here support the unresolved/between reference-split classification under this particular NJ/MAFFT design, NOT 100% evidence for a distinct intermediate enzyme.",
    "The source set includes partial transcript assemblies, variable reference protein completeness and only 2-3 taxa per biochemical reference family.",
    "Site bootstrap assumes conditionally independent aligned AA columns; biochemical family and genuine orthology need broader taxon sampling and more rigorous gene trees.",
    "Identity-difference 95% intervals include zero in every tested query case, so enzyme family identity is unresolved here; crossing zero does not prove equivalence.",
    "Catalytic residue matches/substitutions are site observations, never proof of a functional or defective enzyme.",
    "The 2020 Cirsium source transcripts have no linked floral phenotype, treatment or Ryukyu ancestry record."
  ]
